<title>USA: Jostens to repurchase shares.</title>
<headline>Jostens to repurchase shares.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jostens Inc said Thursday its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to $100 million in shares of its common stock.</p>
<p>The yearbook and class ring company said it has about 38.8 million shares outstanding.</p>
</text>
